# Google Sheets Authentication (Optional)
# =========================================

# For PUBLIC or SHARED Google Sheets:
# - No credentials needed! The script will access the sheet directly via URL

# For PRIVATE Google Sheets:
# - Create a service account: https://console.cloud.google.com/
# - Download the JSON key file
# - Point to it here (add this file to .gitignore!)

GOOGLE_CREDENTIALS_PATH=./google-credentials.json

# Alternative: If using OAuth2 instead of service account
# GOOGLE_OAUTH_TOKEN=./google_token.json
